# How to cite this repository. GitHub shows it as "Cite this repository", and
# Zenodo reads it when it archives a release, so this is the one place the
# authors and the description are written. The licence is not declared here:
# the INTO-CPS Association Public License has no SPDX identifier, which is the
# only form the licence field accepts. LICENSE.md is the reference.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ifc-utils: IFC and BIM Utilities for the DTaaS Platform"
abstract: >-
  Packages that convert an IFC building model into geometry a browser can draw,
  and read the manifest that binds a sensor to an object in the model. They
  serve the Building Models page of the Digital Twin as a Service (DTaaS)
  platform.
authors:
  - given-names: "Jady Pamella"
    family-names: "Barbacena da Silva"
    affiliation: "Aarhus University"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4280-3364"
repository-code: "https://github.com/INTO-CPS-Association/ifc-utils"
url: "https://www.npmjs.com/package/@into-cps-association/bim-kit"
keywords:
  - IFC
  - BIM
  - digital twin
  - DTaaS
  - sensor binding
